--   - 25 Warehouse & Store Lots (full stock at CW + all 4 Retail Stores)
--   - 2 Roast Batches, Master Menu + 6 Variants + 6 Modifiers + 6 BOM Recipes
--   - 2 B2B Customers + 4 Price Tiers + 2 B2B Orders + 1 B2C Retail Order + AR Ledger
--   - 4 RECONCILED Internal Transfers (for real Intercompany Elimination) + 1 REQUESTED
--   - Closed & Open POS Shifts across all 4 Stores (for real Labor & Cash Variance)
--   - Paid POS Orders across ALL 4 Stores + Active KDS Tickets on Store 1 & Store 2
--   - Sample EOD Stocktakes on Store 1 & Store 2
-- ============================================================================

